<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Corfinsura upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Corfinsura upped to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analyst Ricardo Pico raised his rating for Colombia's Corfinsura SA Tuesday to buy from sell.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We have upgraded Corfinsura from sell to buy due to its excellent fundamentals and large discounts to the market,&quot; he wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were unchanged at 2,400 pesos in Bogota.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
